Relay for iPhone is a port of the Relay Android client (https://github.com/chart21/relay, MIT, see LICENSE).

Third-party parts (Swift Package Manager):
  - Citadel (orlandos-nl/Citadel), MIT
  - swift-nio-ssh (fork used by Citadel), Apache-2.0
  - swift-nio, swift-crypto, swift-log, swift-atomics, swift-collections, swift-system, swift-asn1 (Apple), Apache-2.0
  - BigInt (attaswift), MIT
